# Bang chung cua phien POC: to, sinh lai duoc, va co the chua noi dung tin test.
#
# Ca thu muc `evidence/` bi loai, khong chi rieng `otlp/` + `logs/` nhu ban dau. Ly do: ban dau
# bo sot `evidence/human-debug-answer-*.md` (DAP AN cua hai bai tap go roi — commit len la bai tap
# mat gia tri) va `evidence/otlp-*/` (batch OTLP thuc te co the mang noi dung tin test).
# Loai ca thu muc thi mot lan chay POC moi sinh them thu muc bang chung nao cung khong lot ra.
evidence/
.env.poc
